{"seq":29,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"5b120f43-cdd1-4b7e-8d20-30fef6cbe2ce","runId":"run_1_1788364152732","result":"Done! I've saved the regex to `/app/regex.txt`. Here's how it works:\n\n**Key components:**\n\n1. **IPv4 lookahead**: `(?=.*\\b(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\d|1\\d{2}|[1-9]?\\d)\\....)` — ensures the line contains a valid IPv4 address with word boundaries (`\\b`) to avoid false matches like \"user192.168.1.1\"\n\n2. **IPv4 pattern** breaks down as:\n   - `25[0-5]` matches 250-255\n   - `2[0-4]\\d` matches 200-249\n   - `1\\d{2}` matches 100-199\n   - `[1-9]?\\d` matches 0-99\n   - No leading zeros allowed\n\n3. **Last date matching**: `.*(?<![A-Za-z0-9])` — greedy matching followed by negative lookbehind ensures we match up to (but not into) the last date\n\n4. **Date validation** with three alternatives:\n   - `\\d{4}-(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])` — 31-day months (Jan, Mar, May, Jul, Aug, Oct, Dec)\n   - `\\d{4}-(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)` — 30-day months (Apr, Jun, Sep, Nov)\n   - `\\d{4}-02-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-9])` — February (01-29)\n\n5. **Boundaries**: `(?<![A-Za-z0-9])` and `(?![A-Za-z0-9])` prevent matching partial alphanumeric sequences\n\nThe regex will correctly extract only the last YYYY-MM-DD date from each line that contains an IPv4 address.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":137974,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5b120f43-cdd1-4b7e-8d20-30fef6cbe2ce","total_cost_usd":0.1357896,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21510,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":20999,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":20147},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21510},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":507,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20567,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2